# BY HAND: SEL + a page button brings its part in or out at the next chord (Build to 0: the arrangement
# is yours); SEL + white keys: processes on the page's arpeggio
wait 500
press SEL
wait 100
shot sel_map.png
tap ENV
release SEL
expect par1 0
wait 3000
expect part0 0
press SEL
tap ENV
release SEL
wait 3000
expect part0 1
tap ENV
press SEL
tapkey w0
release SEL
wait 3000
expect figuser0 1
shot grow.png
press SEL
tapkey w4
release SEL
wait 3000
expect figuser0 0
